            "review_text": "Roland B\nZurich, Switzerland1774 contributions\n0\nfor locals mainly\nJan 2020\nno English menue, staff speaking only few words English or French... first it was already hard to order. we opted for Tiger Prawns on Garlic and Octopus. it took more then half an hour, until we finally got something. the prawns were fine, but the Octopus was absolutely tasteless and chewy. all together we recommend this place only for locals and hard-core seafood specialists.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 1, 2020",
