            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Bien Dong",
            "review_text": "KrystalCoast\nSwansboro, North Carolina88 contributions\n0\nSeafood Delight\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nFound this seafood restaurant on Tripadvisor . Short walk from our hotel . Tour guide joined us for dinner, she had never been to this restaurant . We arrived at 6:30 pm and were seated immediately . We took a tour of the live seafood tanks full of fish shrimp shellfish, octopus . Menu was in Vietnamese only but fortunately showed us a menu with pictures we ordered 3 different plates along with a vegetable and rice dishes . Everything was fantastic even our guide was very impressed with the food . Service was excellent would highly recommend for the serious seafood lover\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 11, 2018",
