            "review_text": "Alan S\nMelbourne, Australia152 contributions\n0\nA Plethora Of Live Seafood\nApr 2018\nI really rate this seafood bbq restaurant. The setting is a large covered outdoor area with various live fish tanks and ponds. Three of us dined and I selected a small lobster, 1/2kg razor clams, 1/2kg prawns all swimming in the ponds, the food was simply BBQ’d and served with a selection on sauces and we also ordered a salad. Total cost with drinks was around USD$60 for 3 people. I believe this represents value. The only downside for some was the lack of an English language menu and zero English speaking staff. I personally did not find this an issue as the live tanks provide a visual menu and the staff can point to the per kg price on the menu.\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
