            "review_text": "Mia L\nStockholm, Sweden11 contributions\n0\nEarly afternoon - had to wait an hour\nJan 2018\nI came 4 pm and there were no other customers but me. Nobody spoke English and there was a lot of misunderstandings. One hour later I finally got what I ordered. The grilled fish (214 000d) was delicious and juicy. The fried rice with shrimp and vegetables (95 000d) was not very good. The rice was dry and so were the shrimps; dry and overcooked. The vegetables were good. Alert! They don’t have rice noodles, only egg noodles, and they don’t understand when you say that you want rice noodles.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2018",
